==Battleground==
*8 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher A]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*8 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*7 [[Gary Gory|Gary Gories]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Ursamajor]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Your greatest chance will be using [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Psychocat]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]], and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]], alongside any decent [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|Anti-Traitless Cat]]. It is also recommended that you unlock any [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] available, though this may not be required. With all of this, the stage should not be too difficult.

